# Capstone Full-Stack SaaS Project

## Week 1 Progress & Architecture Overview

### Day 1 & Day 2: Backend Core Setup
- Initialized Node.js and Express backend server.
- Integrated SQLite database via Sequelize ORM.
- Configured health check and database test endpoints.

### Day 3: Frontend Setup
- Initialized React application using Vite.
- Created reusable `StatusCard` component.
- Successfully connected frontend with backend API (`/api/test`).

### Day 4: Environment & Container Configuration
- Configured `.env` environment variables using `dotenv`.
- Created basic `Dockerfile` for containerization.
- Configured Vite proxy server for API requests (`/api`).

### Day 5: Week 1 Review & Finalization
- Code review and bug fixes completed.
- Full-stack workflow verified end-to-end.
# Capstone Full-Stack SaaS Project

## Week 1 Progress & Architecture Overview

### Day 1 & Day 2: Backend Core Setup
- Initialized Node.js and Express backend server.
- Integrated SQLite database via Sequelize ORM.
- Configured health check and database test endpoints.

### Day 3: Frontend Setup
- Initialized React application using Vite.
- Created reusable `StatusCard` component.
- Successfully connected frontend with backend API (`/api/test`).

### Day 4: Environment & Container Configuration
- Configured `.env` environment variables using `dotenv`.
- Created basic `Dockerfile` for containerization.
- Configured Vite proxy server for API requests (`/api`).

### Day 5: Week 1 Review & Finalization
- Code review and bug fixes completed.
- Full-stack workflow verified end-to-end.

---

## Week 2: Planning & Architectural Design

### Day 8: Project Requirements
- Defined project scope, core SaaS functionalities, and target audience.
- Formulated user personas and technical user stories in `REQUIREMENTS.md`.

### Day 9: System Architecture
- Designed client-server MVC tiered architecture in `ARCHITECTURE.md`.
- Selected technology stack (React, Express, Sequelize, SQLite/PostgreSQL) and cloud deployment strategy.

### Day 10: Database & Storage Strategy
- Mapped relational entity schemas for Users, Projects, and Tasks in `DATABASE.md`.
- Planned cloud object storage integration and data backup recovery policies.

### Day 11: Project Timeline & QA Strategy
- Formulated Work Breakdown Structure (WBS) and milestone schedules in `PROJECT_PLAN.md`.
- Defined dependency risk mitigation matrix and test coverage protocols.

### Day 12: Week 2 Review & GitHub Finalization
- Verified end-to-end planning documents and synchronized documentation into GitHub repository.